OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1792416398
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrench PM calls for partial curfews as
OL,4,Ahe condemns 'thieves' and 'thugs'
OL,5,Abehind riots
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, France's Interior Minister
OL,8,FLaurent Nunez said police had "lost
OL,9,Fcontrol" - the head of France's
OL,10,FChambers of Commerce and Industry says
OL,11,F2,000 businesses were directly impacted
OL,12,Fby the demonstrations
OL,14,FNunez - whose offer to resign was
OL,15,Frejected by French President Emmanuel
OL,16,FMacron - said there was a "lack of
OL,17,Fanticipation" from officers
OL,19,FThe disorder began last month with
OL,20,Fstudents protesting over school
OL,21,Fconditions, but have since escalated to
OL,22,Ftake in a broader range of concerns
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
